  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 507.03 One-Rate Vehicles",
  "priorExpiration": "2012-03-15",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 507.03 One-Rate Vehicles.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 261:141, III(l), one-third rate registration fee shall be charged to those vehicles that have equipment mounted on trucks of which the equipment is an integral part of the unit and the truck is not capable of carrying freight or merchandise.\n\n(b) Each applicant requesting a one-third rate registration for a vehicle shall furnish the following to the department:\n\n(1) Manufacturer's specifications for the vehicle, including all additional, permanently mounted equipment, as described in (a) above;\n\n(2) Written description of uses of the vehicle; and\n\n(3) Time and location that the vehicle may be inspected by the department.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); ss by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 508.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
